B.TL=new A.bs("mockito/mocktail Integration Stubbing","BUILD & NATIVE FFI","UNIT TESTING","Unit tests run in isolation without connecting to actual database channels or network ports. Developers compile mock dependencies using `mocktail` or `mockito` and stub returned parameters to test edge cases.","class MockNetworkClient extends Mock implements HttpClient {}\nvoid testCall() {\n  when(() => mockClient.get('/profile')).thenAnswer((_) async => Response(\"Janak\", 200));\n}",B.P6)
